    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it just feels like the hardest part is that there's no reason to keep going through the motions. like, everything is just noise and loss. he was the only thing that made the day feel worth it. now it's just me alone in this quiet house with nothing to show for it. what's the point of all this just to end up alone and sad anyway?",
